a:["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-black uppercase mb-6 leading-tight","children":"The Power of In-Situ Machining for Pump Casing Rehabilitation"}]
b:["$","div",null,{"className":"w-20 h-2 bg-accent mb-12"}]
c:["$","h3","0",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4","children":["Introduction to In-Situ Machining"]}]
d:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["In thermal power stations and heavy chemical plants, large centrifugal pumps—such as Boiler Feed Pumps (BFP) and ",["$","$L2","1",{"href":"/boiler-circulation-pump","className":"text-accent hover:text-black hover:underline font-bold transition-all","children":"Boiler Circulation Pumps (BCP)"}],"—have massive cast or forged steel casings that are directly welded or heavy-flanged into the main process piping."]}]
e:["$","p","2",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["Over years of continuous high-pressure, high-temperature service, the mating faces of these casings inevitably degrade. Steam/water wire-drawing, erosion, and chemical corrosion can cause leaks across the main joint flanges."]}]
f:["$","p","3",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["Historically, repairing these sealing faces required:\n1. Cutting the casing weld joints or unbolting massive pipework.\n2. Rigging and hoisting the multi-ton casing out of the plant.\n3. Transporting it to a heavy machine shop with large boring mills.\n4. Re-welding and heat-treating the casing back into the process line."]}]
10:["$","p","4",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["This cycle could easily take ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-extrabold text-black","children":"2 to 3 weeks of critical outage time"}],", costing plants millions of rupees in lost production. ",["$","$L2","3",{"href":"/services#insitu-machining","className":"text-accent hover:text-black hover:underline font-bold transition-all","children":"In-situ machining"}]," solves this problem by bringing the machine tool to the workpiece."]}]
11:["$","p","5",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["---"]}]
12:["$","h3","6",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4","children":["Portable Precision: How In-Situ Machining Works"]}]
13:["$","p","7",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["",["$","$L2","1",{"href":"/services#insitu-machining","className":"text-accent hover:text-black hover:underline font-bold transition-all","children":"In-situ (or on-site) machining"}]," uses high-precision portable boring bar systems, flange facers, and milling machines that are mounted directly onto or inside the pump casing."]}]
14:["$","ul","8",{"className":"list-disc list-inside space-y-3 text-sm text-foreground/80 font-medium my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-extrabold text-black","children":"Rigid Alignment:"}]," The portable machine is centered using micro-dial indicators relative to the pump's original bore centerline."]}],["$","li","1",{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-extrabold text-black","children":"Single-Setup Operation:"}]," The machine can perform boring, face cutting, counterboring, and groove cutting in a single setup to ensure absolute concentricity."]}],["$","li","2",{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-extrabold text-black","children":"Surface Finish Quality:"}]," Modern portable tools are capable of achieving surface finishes down to ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-extrabold text-black","children":"Ra 1.6 or Ra 0.8 micrometers"}],", matching workshop-grade tolerance levels."]}]]}]
15:["$","p","9",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["---"]}]
16:["$","h3","10",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4","children":["Key Applications in Pump Rehabilitation"]}]
17:["$","h4","11",{"className":"text-base font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-2","children":["1. Flange Face Re-Facing\nErosion or blowout of gaskets ruins the serrated finish of casing joints. Portable flange facers cut a new gramophone or spiral serrated finish onto the gasket mating face, restoring seal integrity."]}]
18:["$","h4","12",{"className":"text-base font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-2","children":["2. Bore Machining and Sleeving\nWear-ring landing bores inside the pump casing erode over time, increasing the gap between the casing and impeller wear ring. This bypass flow reduces pump efficiency. In-situ boring bars machine the worn bore oversize, allowing a custom sleeve to be shrunk-fit and bored back to original design dimensions."]}]
19:["$","h4","13",{"className":"text-base font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-2","children":["3. Stud Extraction and Thread Re-cutting\nCorroded or seized casing studs often snap during disassembly. On-site drilling and tapping units extract the broken stud and re-cut the thread (or install thread inserts) without compromising casing integrity."]}]
1a:["$","p","14",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["---"]}]
1b:["$","h3","15",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4","children":["Economic and Operational Benefits"]}]
1c:["$","p","16",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["The principal benefit of on-site machining is ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-extrabold text-black","children":"time compression"}],". By eliminating the need to cut the casing out of the system:\n- Outage windows are compressed from weeks to ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-extrabold text-black","children":"24–48 hours"}],".\n- Rigging risks in cramped power plant corridors are eliminated.\n- Welded piping joints are left untouched, avoiding post-weld heat treatment (PWHT) and radiographic testing."]}]
1d:["$","h3","17",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4","children":["Conclusion"]}]
1e:["$","p","18",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["At DEI VOX, our dedicated in-situ machining division is equipped with state-of-the-art portable machine tools and highly trained machinists. We mobilize quickly to power plants across India, restoring pump casings and large industrial flanges to original tolerances directly on-site."]}]
